{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（7日）凌晨5時許，消防接報指尖沙咀棉登徑28至30號一幢商業大廈、4樓一間貿易公司的火警鐘響鳴。消防到場了解情況，發現上址確實冒煙，火警鐘</p><p>就現場所見，涉事單位仍有煙冒出，消防員進入大廈調查冒煙原因。據了解，初步相信單位內一部抽濕機過熱引致冒煙。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128943271008014336631870.jpeg/0Vhc4yckpiOUbSVTY0vrBGJJDVESibMM9O8HvM7vB7w\" alt=\"涉事單位仍有煙冒出。\"><figcaption>涉事單位仍有煙冒出。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128942246301798400542691.jpeg/N8ahZ6RvBwpHzwMQjVwbVE5BZu6wbZkax3IEwP1yBMA\" alt=\"消防到場開喉灌救。\"><figcaption>消防到場開喉灌救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128942288362803200047826.jpeg/FBJscWPi1vfodufLe0R-zdYzh9Enomg5H7fm5CW35uQ\" alt=\"消防在場處理。\"><figcaption>消防在場處理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128942279013437440687359.jpeg/tZRQrjkPQ9g1AB6DOceeWNDfRVlGnSKzmy5l6KEuZeg\" alt=\"消防在場處理。\"><figcaption>消防在場處理。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128942274789642240902478.jpeg/v6fl8qiJ-msYnoJd5Kal0zl3Arbib_jnf1ADV0VQA1c\" alt=\"消防員進入大廈調查。\"><figcaption>消防員進入大廈調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260507/1128942268049264640690318.jpeg/wZ7I90JRkHzwTvAHdSTn7kfI_0MdJqwjLpraPRSa2j0\" alt=\"現場是尖沙咀棉登徑28至30號。\"><figcaption>現場是尖沙咀棉登徑28至30號。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T23:00:45.974355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}